# Credit Card Fraud Detection

A Machine Learning project that detects fraudulent credit card transactions using a Random Forest Classifier.

## Technologies

- Python
- NumPy
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn

## Workflow

```text
Data Loading
↓
Data Preprocessing
↓
EDA
↓
Train-Test Split
↓
Feature Scaling
↓
Random Forest
↓
Model Evaluation
